desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "golang"
	title: "Struct scan: Go http.Get"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Go http.Get"
	type: vuln
	level: medium
	rule_id: "struct-go-http-get"
	risk: "ssrf"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 http.Get。URL 若外部可控可导致 SSRF。

### 风险类型
ssrf

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
固定主机或使用允许列表。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://h.go": <<<POS
package main
import "net/http"
func g(u string) { http.Get(u) }

POS
	"safefile://s.go": <<<NEG
package main
func g(u string) {}

NEG
)

http.Get as $call
http.Get(* as $u) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "medium",
	title: "Struct scan: Go http.Get",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Go http.Get",
	message: "结构扫描：Go http.Get",
	risk: "ssrf",
}
